== Walkthrough ==

Kazlo Naedra patrols South Qeynos from Wrin Liltin near the Mermaid's Lure, to the area outside the warrior guild, to the area by Fish's Ale.

You say, 'Hail, Kazlo Naedra'

: Kazlo Naedra says 'Hail, ______. I'm Kazlo Naedra of the Order of Three. We always seem to be running out of [supplies] around here, which is, of course, very distracting to our studies.'

You say, 'What supplies?'

: Kazlo Naedra says 'Yes, we're almost out of [blank scroll sheets]. Gahlith will be very upset, unless I can replenish our inventory soon.'

You say, 'What blank scroll sheets?'

: Kazlo Naedra says 'These blank sheets seem harder to find every month. All the local merchants are out of them. Hopefully, one of the merchants out in Surefall will have some.'

'''You can purchase Blank Scroll Sheets from [[Sequea Erthinon]] in the Jaggedpine Treefolk store in Surefall Glades.'''

(You can also purchase the sheets from [[Den Magason]] in South Qeynos for 2gp.)

Your Location is -154.95, -292.89, 3.14 

Sequea Erthinon tells you, 'That'll be 1 silver 5 copper for the Blank Scroll Sheets.'

'''Give the sheets to Kazlo.'''

: Kazlo Naedra says 'Good work, ______! Here's a little something for your troubles. Your quick work and loyalty will be noted by the Order of Three.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Order of Three]] has been adjusted by 5.
* Your faction standing with [[Bloodsabers]] has been adjusted by -1.
* Your faction standing with [[Guards of Qeynos]] has been adjusted by 5.
* Your faction standing with [[Opal Dark Briar]] has been adjusted by -1.
</div>
